(32, 'Syed Rafiq Ahmed ', 'srahmed1973@gmail.com', '9849601037', 'Hi, \n\nMy self Ahmed, am from Hyderabad. I follow all ur accounts on all social media since 2022, I want to check if you can provide australia work permit, I don\'t have IELTS, no funds to show, only SSC pass. My date of birth is 1973.\n\nI have travelled, Italy, turkey, jordan, saudi arabia, UAE.\n\nI got 2 times malaysia tourist visa before Covid both time 1 year multiple entry visa ingot...but not travelled. Also I had japan tourist visa in 2023 but here also did not travel due to some personal reasons.\n\nI had applied for Canada visitor visa in 2022, got rejection.\nI had applied USA B1B2 in 2023 2 times and 1 time 2024...all 3 times B1B2 visa refused. Again in 2024 applied for Australia visitor visa.....this also got rejection.\n\nIf you can help me work permit for Australia I will come to your office to discuss. I will handover only passport and if required SSC certificate, as I don\'t have funds ready in hand...I can pay you after I het my visa...by showing approved visa I can take loan and pay you.\n\nPlz update if possible and if I should come to meet u.\n\nWaiting for your kind reply.\n\nThanks\nAhmed ', '2025-10-13 16:42:01', 'unDone'),
(33, 'Vinod Oswal ', 'thevinodoswal@gmail.com', '7685066666', 'Hello sir/maam,\nHappy dipawali all team\n\nI\'m Vinod Oswal from indore mp\nI\'m only 9th pass and 10 th failed \nI need your help for europ work (job) and all \nThank you \nVinod Oswal \n7685066666', '2025-10-17 12:47:13', 'unDone'),
